# needs-native-review: game mechanics dials, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsDialWords.ts
msgctxt "game variable map.concierge_enabled, description"
msgid "The 'what do you want to do?' bar that routes a member to the right circle, role or quest. Deterministic matching always runs first; the assistant is only consulted for ambiguous asks, and only when an API key is configured."
msgstr "La barra de '¿qué quiere hacer?' que dirige a un miembro al círculo, rol o misión correctos. La coincidencia determinista siempre corre primero; al asistente solo se le consulta para pedidos ambiguos, y solo cuando hay una clave de API configurada."

# needs-native-review: game mechanics dials, 26 Nov 2026
#: client/src/pages/gameMechanicsDialWords.ts
msgctxt "game variable map.contact_daily_cap, label"
msgid "Contact requests a member may send per day"
