msgctxt "game variable platform.admin_helper, description"
msgid "Lets admins ask the village guide for help inside Admin: finding a page or setting, explaining a control, and proposing a settings change that an admin applies with a click. It reads settings, help text and the shape of the org chart only, never applications, proposals, people's details, terms or pay, and it does not help choose people for roles. It turns on by itself once the village connects an AI key: its own Anthropic key, or Sera when the org memory connection is set up. Turn this off to keep it off."
